<title>INDIA: Indian cotton market shut for Buddhist holiday.</title>
<headline>Indian cotton market shut for Buddhist holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bombay cotton market was officially closed on Thursday to mark the birthday of Lord Buddha. The market will reopen for trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
